00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:13,480
In the last episode, the raid on Nintendough's home

20
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:15,480
Was a success

21
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:18,480
The runaway Princess Ye returned home on her own

22
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:25,480
However, this Princess Ye was actually Shaker from The Illumin-Eye in disguise

23
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:29,840
After the truth came out, she fled with the treasure, Ocean Princess

24
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:31,900
As for the real Princess Ye

25
00:01:31,900 --> 00:01:33,799
She is still missing

26
00:01:33,799 --> 00:01:35,859
Ocean Princess

27
00:01:35,859 --> 00:01:48,480
Dottie

28
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,900
I completed the mission.

29
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:50,240
Look.

30
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:52,439
This is the Ocean Princess statue.

31
00:01:52,439 --> 00:01:56,180
Ocean Princess

32
00:01:56,180 --> 00:01:57,280
You've made me wait so long.

33
00:01:57,280 --> 00:02:00,180
I want to snuggle close to you and never leave.

34
00:02:00,180 --> 00:02:04,219
Dottie

35
00:02:04,219 --> 00:02:05,640
Please, I beg you.

36
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:07,519
Stay with me a little longer, okay?

37
00:02:07,519 --> 00:02:09,920
You still have time to sit here?

38
00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:11,500
The enemy will appear any moment.

39
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:14,199
No matter how you dress up,

40
00:02:14,199 --> 00:02:16,719
you can't hide your ugly, greedy nature.

41
00:02:16,719 --> 00:02:20,639
Why... even when you scold me, I'm still so... handsome.

42
00:02:20,639 --> 00:02:26,599
Where did Uncle go?

43
00:02:26,599 --> 00:02:28,780
He left early in the morning without a word.

44
00:02:28,780 --> 00:02:30,560
Seventy-Six, don't worry.

45
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,460
Here, have some juice.

46
00:02:31,460 --> 00:02:33,560
That despicable Hawxing.

47
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:36,120
He must have known all along that we were tricked.

48
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:38,439
He deliberately waited to see us make fools of ourselves.

49
00:02:38,439 --> 00:02:40,240
It must be.

50
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,859
No, no, that can't be.

51
00:02:41,859 --> 00:02:43,079
Which side are you on?

52
00:02:43,079 --> 00:02:45,259
And that hateful female thief.

53
00:02:45,259 --> 00:02:46,620
If I knew where she was,

54
00:02:46,620 --> 00:02:48,379
I would never let her go!

55
00:02:48,379 --> 00:02:50,000
I know.

56
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,879
They're dueling at the Green Spear Fish Restaurant.

57
00:02:52,879 --> 00:02:54,560
How do you know?

58
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:56,579
I'm an angel.

59
00:02:56,580 --> 00:03:01,580
I can hear the whispers of little bugs from far away.

60
00:03:03,580 --> 00:03:07,580
Scared, Jingjing? You really are an angel.

61
00:03:13,580 --> 00:03:17,580
Lord Shaker, Hawxing has entered the restaurant.

62
00:03:17,580 --> 00:03:25,860
Hello? Officer Han, emergency.

63
00:03:47,580 --> 00:03:51,940
Not bad moves.

64
00:03:51,940 --> 00:03:53,360
I knew I was right about you.

65
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:57,300
You really are a worthy opponent.

66
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:14,260
Who are you, really?

67
00:04:14,260 --> 00:04:24,540
Where is Princess Ye?

68
00:04:24,540 --> 00:04:28,340
She's already injured.

69
00:04:28,340 --> 00:04:29,819
Stop fighting.

70
00:04:29,819 --> 00:04:32,160
Don't fight.

71
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:34,420
Stop it.

72
00:04:44,259 --> 00:04:59,579
Big... Big sis, the cops are here!

73
00:04:59,579 --> 00:05:04,459
The suspect has been caught.

74
00:05:04,459 --> 00:05:06,719
She must know the whereabouts of the statue and the hostage.

75
00:05:14,259 --> 00:05:16,420
Everyone, please release Shaker.

76
00:05:16,420 --> 00:05:19,120
Otherwise I'll kill Princess Ye immediately.

77
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:21,159
That old guy looks so familiar.

78
00:05:21,159 --> 00:05:23,000
You again, Mr. K.

79
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:25,300
It's your Illumin-Eye's doing again.

80
00:05:25,300 --> 00:05:26,800
My dear friend,

81
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:28,959
you're always so happy to see me.

82
00:05:28,959 --> 00:05:30,920
It makes me so embarrassed~

83
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:33,060
Darn it, what Illumin-Eye?

84
00:05:33,060 --> 00:05:34,060
So despicable.

85
00:05:34,060 --> 00:05:36,159
Always pulling this disgusting stuff.

86
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:39,199
You're a truly hateful villain.

87
00:05:39,500 --> 00:05:41,800
You'd better make a decision fast.

88
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,000
You're lying.

89
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:45,319
Princess Ye isn't on that plane at all.

90
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:47,439
If we hand you the suspect,

91
00:05:47,439 --> 00:05:49,740
then Princess Ye would really be in danger.

92
00:05:49,740 --> 00:05:53,319
Guess what this is.

93
00:05:53,319 --> 00:05:59,139
This disc has a special antivirus program burned on it.

94
00:05:59,139 --> 00:06:03,339
Only it can wipe the virus from the Ye family's computer.

95
00:06:03,339 --> 00:06:05,279
What's the big deal?

96
00:06:05,279 --> 00:06:08,519
My uncle can write the same program in just one day.

97
00:06:08,519 --> 00:06:11,839
Besides, what does that have to do with Princess Ye's life?

98
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:14,360
I believe Detective Chen has that skill.

99
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:15,560
But sorry,

100
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:17,280
you only have five minutes.

101
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:19,480
Because we have already notified Princess Ye

102
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,440
