108
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:34,800
Oh~ what a tragedy

109
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:37,480
Now do you think this disc is precious?

110
00:06:38,780 --> 00:06:40,480
Let her go

111
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:45,780
Hand over the disc to us first

112
00:06:45,780 --> 00:06:47,640
Or I'll shoot

113
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:50,740
Oh, of course

114
00:06:50,740 --> 00:06:52,840
A big deal needs honesty

115
00:06:52,840 --> 00:07:01,940
Sima

116
00:07:01,940 --> 00:07:03,180
Notify headquarters

117
00:07:03,180 --> 00:07:05,100
Request police helicopter backup

118
00:07:05,100 --> 00:07:05,860
Jimmy

119
00:07:05,860 --> 00:07:06,880
How much time is left?

120
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:08,220
Only two minutes

121
00:07:08,220 --> 00:07:09,440
