122
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:30,640
Miss, we're home

123
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:56,520
Hey, Lord Ye

124
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:58,680
What?! How could this be? How could this be?

125
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,520
Quick quick quick

126
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:12,340
Ah

127
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:20,240
Stop it

128
00:08:37,340 --> 00:08:37,740
Ah

129
00:08:38,340 --> 00:08:39,139
Great

130
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,740
Hahahaha

131
00:08:40,740 --> 00:08:42,740
Time to eat

132
00:08:50,740 --> 00:08:51,740
Hawxing

133
00:08:51,740 --> 00:08:54,740
Whether or not I can truly be considered Princess Ye's mother

134
00:08:54,740 --> 00:08:57,740
I still want to thank you for saving my daughter

135
00:08:57,740 --> 00:08:59,740
After what happened this time

136
00:08:59,740 --> 00:09:02,740
Ye Yongfu has realized that his daughter is the one he should value most

137
00:09:02,740 --> 00:09:05,740
I cannot forgive my own mistake

138
00:09:05,740 --> 00:09:06,740
As punishment

139
00:09:06,740 --> 00:09:08,740
